      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Atlas invitation flow decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "FICTIONAL TRAINING EXAMPLE | Product lead | 15 September 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Agree to a focused test of an invitation entry point in Members, comparing it with a feasible…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What the study supports"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "SYN-S01: eight purposively selected, fictional English-language desktop prototype sessions. These…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "F01: 6/8 searched Members first; 4/8 needed assistance. F02: 3/8 asked about role permissions. F03: 8/8…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Options and recommendation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Decision and next check"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Proposed and awaiting a decision. Proposed owner: product lead with design and research; acceptance and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision IDs D01-D03 and evidence paths are on pages 2-3. No implementation or measured outcome is…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Finding evidence and interpretation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Fictional study SYN-S01 | Desktop prototype v0.1 | Eight first-time workspace admins"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "F01 Six of eight first-time admins looked in Members for teammate invitations."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observed: Six initially searched Members; four of the eight participants needed a moderator hint to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation: The control location may conflict with some first-time admins’ expectations. This is an…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Next step: Test a Members invitation entry point against a feasible alternative before broader rollout."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "F02 Three participants asked what access the Collaborator role granted."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observed: Role-scope uncertainty appeared in three of eight sessions."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation: The role label alone may not communicate enough permission detail."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Next step: Test a concise permission description with the role choice."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "F03 All eight noticed the confirmation after completing invitations; four completed with assistance."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observed: Confirmation was noticed following both assisted and unassisted completions."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation: Preserve this feedback while testing changes elsewhere; this does not establish…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Next step: Retain the confirmation in candidate prototypes and check it again."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Decision record and source register"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "All records below belong to the fictional Atlas training fixture. Proposed roles have not accepted…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Owners and review triggers"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "D01: product lead + design/research; revisit after a scoped follow-up. D02: content design + product…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Evidence paths"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "F01 uses E01, E02, E03, E05, E06 and E08; E04 and E07 are counterexamples. F02 uses E02, E04 and E06;…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Source: atlas_fixture.json#/evidence/0 through /7 correspond to E01 through E08. The complete fixture,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What remains unknown"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A better location is an interpretation to test, not a proven cause or validated solution. The study…"
    }
